OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and sunny day today
OL,6,Facross the region, although the
OL,7,Fsunshine may turn rather hazy at
OL,8,Ftimes. Feeling very warm in the
OL,9,Fsunshine and light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and fine evening to
OL,12,Fcome with plenty of late sunshine.
OL,13,FOvernight some cloud will build,
OL,14,Fespecially across the north and west
OL,15,Fof the region. A rather warm night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA bright start but skies
OL,18,Fbecoming rather cloudy throughout the
OL,19,Fmorning. Remaining dry throughout
OL,20,Fthough with sunshine returning later.
OL,21,FFeeling a little cooler but still warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
